@* A row of verbs on a dashboard card: a tap on a
   button runs it and goes no further, so the card is not selected by it. As
   wide as the footer, so the row's two groups stand at its two ends as in the
   list's card. The verbs are View's: in Edit they are inert, and the whole
   footer answers to the hand that arranges it. *@

<div class="wslc-verb-taps" @onclick:stopPropagation="true">
    @ChildContent
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public RenderFragment ChildContent { get; set; } = default!;
}
